# The fixtures are hashed byte-for-byte by the packer (scripts/build-clank.mjs).
# core.autocrlf on Windows would otherwise check them out as CRLF while the
# committed container holds LF bytes — making "rebuild the .clank" produce a
# different content_hash on Windows than on Linux or macOS. Pin the fixture
# tree to LF so the packed artifact is reproducible on every OS. The archive
# and the rasters are binary and must never be line-end converted.
src/fixtures/** text eol=lf
*.clank binary
*.clank.b64 binary
*.png binary